 "quality": {
  "flags": [],
  "notes": "Per-cycle voltage-current-capacity DataFrames with the authors' RUL and dq; no temperature channel. Current is in mA and capacity in mAh (from the column names). Voltage cutoffs and manufacturer are not stated on the landing page, so voltage_min_V/voltage_max_V stay null (not inferred from the matching 1.1 Ah/3.3 V A123 spec). Charge/discharge rate estimates, where explicitly marked raw_data in the citations, use signed observed current extrema divided by the stored nominal Ah. These are measurement estimates over the cached extraction scope, not imposed CC protocol setpoints; they may include pulse, dynamic, regenerative or diagnostic segments and measurement excursions. Current units and direction were checked against the cited original headers, status labels or separate charge/discharge counters. cached extraction covers all 77 recognised pickle cell records; both maximum values were independently located in their original per-cycle DataFrames. The observed maxima are approximately 5C with small measurement variations; the exact protocol setpoint is not inferred by rounding them to 5C."
 },
